From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:54:58 +0000
Subject: media: cedrus: vc1: check the entry-point header control

cedrus_try_ctrl() rejects VC-1 entry-point headers whose coded width is
below the 128 pixels the hardware decodes correctly, but the control was
registered without the driver's control ops, so the check never ran.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
index 66ed80182..9e4f5b473 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
@@ -431,6 +431,7 @@ static const struct cedrus_control cedrus_controls[] = {
 	{
 		.cfg = {
 			.id	= V4L2_CID_STATELESS_VC1_ENTRYPOINT_HEADER,
+			.ops	= &cedrus_ctrl_ops,
 		},
 		.capabilities	= CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_VC1_DEC,
 	},
